WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.830
Your volunteer page. Your shifts, hours and paperwork, all in one place.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:11.950
Your page opens with your name at the top. Family on this device? Tap a name to switch.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:16.588
Paperwork shows whether you're cleared to work, and when each document runs out.

00:00:16.788 --> 00:00:19.861
Your next shift shows the date, the stand, and the time.

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:27.770
The stand lead's Call and Text buttons show up closer to the shift. Running late, or can't make it? Call or text them.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:33.122
If something needs attention, it shows here, with an Upload paperwork button.

00:00:33.322 --> 00:00:39.950
Signed up for more than one spot? A pink card asks who's working them. There's a separate video for that.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:45.601
Tap See all my shifts for a calendar. Blue is coming up. Grey is already worked.

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:46.953
Tap a shift,

00:00:47.153 --> 00:00:51.560
to see its details, with the stand lead's Call and Text buttons.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:57.211
Hours this season shows your total, split by the student each shift counted for.

00:00:57.411 --> 00:01:02.681
Below that is each student's total from everyone in your family, and what isn't paid out yet.

00:01:02.881 --> 00:01:07.212
A recent shift shows as pending, until the IU liaison approves it.

00:01:07.412 --> 00:01:13.471
Hours history, updating your info and paperwork, and contacting the liaison are at the bottom.

00:01:13.671 --> 00:01:22.410
On a shared device? Sign-ins and my data, at the very bottom, lets you forget people on that device. There's a short video on it.

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:29.255
Hours history lists every shift: the date, the stand, the hours, and the student it counted for.

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:33.280
Pending shifts are at the bottom, until they're approved.

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:39.070
Questions? Email the IU liaison from the bottom of any Hub page.
